           ButtonData -> "paclet:TBMethod/ref/PauliGellMannRepresent"]], 
         "InlineFormula", FontFamily -> "Source Sans Pro"], 
        " to recover a matrix expression."}], "Notes", CellID -> 333846244]}, 
